    {
      "id": "u_9f1a4bfdeb544d75942f1b93_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The mindmap allows for easy jotting down of ideas and storing them in a hierarchical fashion.",
      "sourceHash": "9f1a4bfdeb544d75942f1b93fee9a90f8fb036395553d00cf859e786fb8621a0",
      "context": "Mind Map",
      "contextHash": "c9180fbad382604f3be7a6ac12eaeb25aa8f5bd3ca5de8179e47d234fa5454d5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4ad084f6f9c1e41dceaac3bd_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Terminology__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "4ad084f6f9c1e41dceaac3bda968c3d0368a1a59c158691869952cbfc1905335",
      "context": "Mind Map > Terminology",
      "contextHash": "7e8793b47a7eda2f9cd434bba9fc34c3a23d76d3c9fc83b624f3e5f14ed2de6e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_55b5f8e62c3ac361476ba3e3_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A __TRILIUM_PH_0__node__TRILIUM_PH_1__ is a single idea, represented differently based on depth (filled rounded rectangle for the root note, unfilled rectangles for sub-ideas, lines only for sub-sub-ideas).",
      "sourceHash": "55b5f8e62c3ac361476ba3e37ec1a45b56ba38ce2b16ca65fcfc603107151292",
      "context": "Mind Map > Terminology",
      "contextHash": "7e8793b47a7eda2f9cd434bba9fc34c3a23d76d3c9fc83b624f3e5f14ed2de6e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5fa997e646412f3d7654204b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__root node__TRILIUM_PH_1__ is the top-most node from which all other nodes derive, displayed as a filled rectangle. There can only be a single root node.",
      "sourceHash": "5fa997e646412f3d7654204bb6ccdf9e6c978e63c6b4330235f9e2da654b7d55",
      "context": "Mind Map > Terminology",
      "contextHash": "7e8793b47a7eda2f9cd434bba9fc34c3a23d76d3c9fc83b624f3e5f14ed2de6e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_27591f4e86746d469eb2d832_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Interaction__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "27591f4e86746d469eb2d8323f6dda382149928ec0550ca8a5a6fdfc24cab9a6",
      "context": "Mind Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "6e60138b9307c8d0a1f7214b0872f662a418c5650f25adef219e8265a93ae635",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_93f1a5c3c985022750fa605e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To create a new node at the same level as the current one, press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_1__, enter the desired text and then press __TRILIUM_PH_2__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_3__ once again to confirm.",
      "sourceHash": "93f1a5c3c985022750fa605ec202ec0d7b36f79fb2ac810cd7995e02ec77d9ee",
      "context": "Mind Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "6e60138b9307c8d0a1f7214b0872f662a418c5650f25adef219e8265a93ae635",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1b4f57a05fd9c3e6e267aa09_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Similarly, to create a sub-node, press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Tab__TRILIUM_PH_1__, enter the desired text and then press __TRILIUM_PH_2__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "1b4f57a05fd9c3e6e267aa094394d7f5745a59ad780f6e0841bbb446ec338855",
      "context": "Mind Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "6e60138b9307c8d0a1f7214b0872f662a418c5650f25adef219e8265a93ae635",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7bbac61f0bdddfc9500d7e3a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To create a parent, use __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_3__ instead.",
      "sourceHash": "7bbac61f0bdddfc9500d7e3ae8e695effe4fd3a659568b710021ba61ae3788e3",
      "context": "Mind Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "6e60138b9307c8d0a1f7214b0872f662a418c5650f25adef219e8265a93ae635",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5a1de6d48c773a5ded521692_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To remove a node, press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Delete__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "5a1de6d48c773a5ded521692da9bcf725ed5225e165521ca9421d5f6b0879201",
      "context": "Mind Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "6e60138b9307c8d0a1f7214b0872f662a418c5650f25adef219e8265a93ae635",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6c6a6ceb649b1424a01b83a8_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To move a node up or down, press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Page Up__TRILIUM_PH_1__ or __TRILIUM_PH_2__Page Down__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "6c6a6ceb649b1424a01b83a88473c25d949f83177291152f8097ab8a80d6223c",
      "context": "Mind Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "6e60138b9307c8d0a1f7214b0872f662a418c5650f25adef219e8265a93ae635",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e06a85147589762093c1eda7_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To adjust the font size, color of the text or background or to add a link, click on a node and use the floating panel that appears to the right.",
      "sourceHash": "e06a85147589762093c1eda7fe83157cf39983946f3efd564a4ec05678415aa7",
      "context": "Mind Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "6e60138b9307c8d0a1f7214b0872f662a418c5650f25adef219e8265a93ae635",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e5816d48953601da42c17f87_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To select one or more notes, drag and drop across the map.",
      "sourceHash": "e5816d48953601da42c17f87c48d0448698d04ed5ca4b8c150d12aaada541c00",
      "context": "Mind Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "6e60138b9307c8d0a1f7214b0872f662a418c5650f25adef219e8265a93ae635",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e7bdf4349b2c5a75a3d2527a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Right click the node to bring a contextual menu with options such as creating new nodes, focusing on a particular notes or creating links between them.",
      "sourceHash": "e7bdf4349b2c5a75a3d2527aabd79c9d1ae3c8a92cd0a9acfa2b6b0fabfcfd38",
      "context": "Mind Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "6e60138b9307c8d0a1f7214b0872f662a418c5650f25adef219e8265a93ae635",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5678f6bcb33475514ebd384e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Use the buttons at the top-left to change the positioning of the nodes relative to the root node (to the left, to the right, or to both sides).",
      "sourceHash": "5678f6bcb33475514ebd384edd4992531fd3a77537217c270244aa8810202f82",
      "context": "Mind Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "6e60138b9307c8d0a1f7214b0872f662a418c5650f25adef219e8265a93ae635",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_433d9383c3a05a49590277e5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "In the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note buttons__TRILIUM_PH_1__ area, an __TRILIUM_PH_2__image reference__TRILIUM_PH_3__ can be copied by pressing the __TRILIUM_PH_4__ button, to paste the mind map in a text note.",
      "sourceHash": "433d9383c3a05a49590277e56854a2f7951c417da5ff3c80dad48461a2dd99ee",
      "context": "Mind Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "6e60138b9307c8d0a1f7214b0872f662a418c5650f25adef219e8265a93ae635",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_eeacd5022a7bc606ce84bf74_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "From the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note menu__TRILIUM_PH_1__, the diagram can be exported either as SVG (vectorial) or PNG (raster) by selecting __TRILIUM_PH_2__Export as image__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "eeacd5022a7bc606ce84bf747e0bfe88644ebb3b41b56016214d3ecdf3e6498f",
      "context": "Mind Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "6e60138b9307c8d0a1f7214b0872f662a418c5650f25adef219e8265a93ae635",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f988167de2edf89b25f05cf7_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The note can be set as __TRILIUM_PH_0__read-only__TRILIUM_PH_1__ which will disable all editing features.",
      "sourceHash": "f988167de2edf89b25f05cf78db8d32b7501bfb85910cfd308dceb1f4b35cdaa",
      "context": "Mind Map > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "6e60138b9307c8d0a1f7214b0872f662a418c5650f25adef219e8265a93ae635",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
